cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TMS NeuroPilot, please cite the release and the paper."
title: "TMS NeuroPilot: guided online TMS mapping with online field optimization"
abstract: >-
  An experimenter-facing controller for robot-assisted transcranial magnetic
  stimulation mapping: coil targets, online finite-element field computation,
  MEP regression and stimulation guidance through InVesalius, together with a
  complete virtual twin of the hardware so the whole workflow runs without a
  physical device.
type: software
